Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The moment I can't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.20,0:00:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but it's a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.90,0:00:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this world?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.84,0:00:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:50.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.60,0:00:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't know what you're gonna say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.96,0:01:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.76,0:01:55.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where they came face-to-face\Nwith Lady Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.66,0:01:56.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora and T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.74,0:01:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,set up to find the rest of us\Nfor the final confrontation,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.68,0:02:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while Tai and Izzy stayed\Nbehind to keep Piedmon busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.60,0:02:04.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you'd mind\Nrescheduling our destruction?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.90,0:02:05.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess not.
Dialogue: 1,0:02:08.44,0:02:14.98,Sign,,0,0,300,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}The Clown From Hell, Piemon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.08,0:02:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've looked everywhere, Gomamon,\Nbut we still can't find Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.28,0:02:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe your harmonica playing\Nis keeping him in hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:23.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, everybody's a critic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.44,0:02:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Joe, look over there! What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.56,0:02:28.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Matt's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.80,0:02:29.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must be close by.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.22,0:02:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we have no idea when he left\Nit, or if he was using it at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.02,0:02:35.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we better keep looking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.02,0:02:37.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't be such a downer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.32,0:02:38.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our first clue in a long time,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.04,0:02:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I want to see a little\Nget-up and golem on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.48,0:02:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'm still pessimistic,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because when we found Matt's\Nharmonica, it let us know where.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:46.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.62,0:02:47.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.78,0:02:49.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that's the spirit, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:50.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've become a real man lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.70,0:02:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.36,0:02:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're saying that I\Nwasn't a real man before, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:58.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you mad enough not to\Nlaugh when I tickle you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.86,0:02:59.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mega Ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we won!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the sparring\Nmatch war, Greymon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.14,0:03:15.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm ready for the main event.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.52,0:03:16.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.50,0:03:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, there\Nwere these Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.60,0:03:23.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then Patamon destroyed\Nthem all. The end.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:25.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense to your storytelling skills,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.50,0:03:27.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd like it better if\Nyour ending were different.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:28.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.22,0:03:30.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't win unless we're all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.06,0:03:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.64,0:03:36.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digivice isn't responding at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.32,0:03:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope we find them soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm getting airsick.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.22,0:03:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never find them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.12,0:03:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The digital world is too big.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.34,0:03:45.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.78,0:03:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Sora. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be able to find Matt\Nand the others, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.68,0:03:55.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I tell him the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.80,0:03:56.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:04:00.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I can say, TK, is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.78,0:04:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:04.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not crying, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.12,0:04:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just something in my eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.60,0:04:07.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.51,0:04:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find them, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.64,0:04:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll find the others because we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:17.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless we fight as a team,\Nwe'll never defeat Patamon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:20.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can't let him destroy\Nthe digital world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.84,0:04:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terraform!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.50,0:04:34.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.50,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should all fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.60,0:04:36.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.80,0:04:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Tai, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.56,0:04:41.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Digimon are still too tired\Nfrom our fight with Lady Devimon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.78,0:04:45.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to wait until we're at full\Nstrength when Matt and the others rejoin us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.64,0:04:46.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope it's soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.26,0:04:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Gabumon?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.50,0:04:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we've been traveling in\Nthis direction a little too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.36,0:04:56.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This cave is starting\Nto give me the creeps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry up and get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.52,0:05:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still not sure what you\Nmean by trying to find yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.48,0:05:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I'd appreciate it if\Nyou didn't look in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure. Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.56,0:05:09.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See, everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.47,0:05:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.84,0:05:12.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can take care of myself just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.80,0:05:16.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been living a lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.86,0:05:18.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not a real blonde?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:24.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kept saying TK needed me, but\Nreally, I was the one who needed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.30,0:05:25.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.70,0:05:30.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to think that my one purpose in\Nlife was to protect my little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.34,0:05:32.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.25,0:05:33.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.48,0:05:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nice going, TK.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.50,0:05:35.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great job, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were so worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.88,0:05:39.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, for a little kid, that\Nwas a pretty big escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.78,0:05:43.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He didn't need me to protect him anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.34,0:05:47.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Tai was much better at acting\Nlike a big brother than I ever was.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.96,0:05:49.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you don't have to act.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.72,0:05:52.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are T .K.'s brother. Tai isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.62,0:05:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.68,0:05:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't act like a brother at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.36,0:05:59.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And even though it made me feel good to\Nthink that I was the only one there for him,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.86,0:06:01.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in reality, all the kids were.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.62,0:06:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's talk about this outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.36,0:06:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something\Nstrange about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why Tai made me so mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.04,0:06:08.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought he was trying to take T .K.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.78,0:06:09.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai might be real bossy\Nand hard-headed sometimes
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.78,0:06:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he never treated T.K. like\Na child. Which is how I've
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,always treated him But I'm\Nthe one who's childish Matt,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stop putting yourself down Sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.54,0:06:24.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you have some teenage angst\NBut you've been a great brother
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to TK I used to think Tai never\Nthought about anyone but himself
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:31.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that actually\Ndescribes me a lot better
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.28,0:06:40.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.19,0:06:42.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt, I think you'd\Nbetter take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.48,0:06:43.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.39,0:06:44.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm no good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.90,0:06:48.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,never go back to being their friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand that if the\Neight of you don't get back together,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the digital world will\Nbe destroyed forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.46,0:06:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't need me, and besides,\Nseven is a luckier number than eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:06:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt, snap out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.40,0:07:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.46,0:07:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.74,0:07:02.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.08,0:07:06.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.10,0:07:12.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.01,0:07:13.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.93,0:07:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.26,0:07:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to quit\Ncomparing yourself to Tai.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like ice cream.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:21.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's vanilla and you're Rocky Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:25.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only one of you is TK's\Nreal brother and it's not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.10,0:07:27.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how much he impresses TK,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai will never be able to break the\Nbomb that you two brothers share.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.24,0:07:31.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, don't you think it would\Nbreak my heart What if you weren't here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:38.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I didn't wait my\Nentire life for you to arrive,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just so you can wallow in self-pity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.90,0:07:42.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.81,0:07:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gabumon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.73,0:07:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Matt, if you really\Nwant to be left alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.52,0:07:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then I'll respect your\Nwishes and disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But only if that's what\Nyou really want me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.92,0:07:54.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I don't really want to be left alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.58,0:07:56.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I never meant to hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.12,0:08:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never let anyone\Nget close to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.52,0:08:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not since my family split up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since then, I've been\Nalone. I figured if my
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.20,0:08:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,family didn't want me\Nthen i would just keep to
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:14.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,myself and never tell\Nanyone what i was feeling
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.34,0:08:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and i swore i would never\Nlet anyone see me cry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.28,0:08:23.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but really all i wanted to do was\Ncry and cry i hate being alone
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i'm here for you matt i used to be\Nlonely too i wandered around the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.02,0:08:31.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,digital world without any friends\Nat all and then after i met you I
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.18,0:08:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knew I'd never be lonely again. I\Nknow what you mean. Me too. After all,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.00,0:08:38.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're the main reason I\Ncame to the digital world
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:41.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the first place. And\Nhere I am lost in this dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.30,0:08:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,strange cave And you're still right by my\Nside That's the sign of a true friend Oh,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.72,0:08:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,shucks I guess I have friends And\Nthat includes TK And my mom and dad
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.16,0:09:02.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I realize I was never really alone\NPeople like me They really, really like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.12,0:09:04.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.36,0:09:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.64,0:09:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been around you this whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:10.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean you haven't noticed it until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.50,0:09:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.96,0:09:12.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.96,0:09:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more you talked about being\Nalone, the bigger that thing got.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.38,0:09:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pitch-black.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.40,0:09:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the feeling I had\Nin my heart just a minute ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.92,0:09:25.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.32,0:09:26.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.40,0:09:28.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.31,0:09:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's the darkness that I've been\Ncarrying around with me this whole time
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.78,0:09:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The darkness that's\Nbeen buried in my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gabumon Now it's ready to swallow\Nme up whole Like Jonah and the whale?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.52,0:09:45.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling that if I\Ndidn't recognize it just now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would have taken over my whole\Nlife But I'm not gonna let that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.22,0:09:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happen? It can't hurt me because I'm\Nnot alone anymore. That's the spirit!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.24,0:09:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to thank you, Gabumon
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.72,0:09:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it, that's\Nwhat friends are for Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.24,0:10:02.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I should be thanking you You're\Nthe best friend a Digimon ever had
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.88,0:10:05.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make a promise that\Nwe'll always be there for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.44,0:10:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,each other No matter what\Nhappens Gabumon and Matt,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.60,0:10:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,friends for life
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.16,0:10:13.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you say, do we have a deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.04,0:10:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A handshake makes it\Nofficial Will a pawshake do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.08,0:10:20.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I promise not to\Ncomplain anymore either Don't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:22.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,start that again If you're\Nupset about something,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should get it off your chest
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.66,0:10:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, if you insist, I'll still\Ncomplain once in a while, but only to you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.84,0:10:33.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Correct me if I'm wrong on this one, Matt,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.88,0:10:36.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but weren't we just in a\Nbig dark cave a minute ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.46,0:10:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, and we were completely lost
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.70,0:10:41.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.61,0:10:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.68,0:10:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.52,0:10:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the man now?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.46,0:10:55.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told you I'd find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.78,0:10:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never doubted you for\Na single minute, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.22,0:10:59.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:01.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said to myself, Joe, I said,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.14,0:11:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,just follow your own path and sooner\Nor later you'll run into Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad it happened\Nbefore I retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.26,0:11:07.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.20,0:11:09.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.38,0:11:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I forgot. Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.74,0:11:12.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your harmonica, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Joe.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.98,0:11:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.06,0:11:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trimpsons!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.32,0:11:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wargreymon's exhausted!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.80,0:11:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't watch anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.10,0:11:35.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay tough!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.04,0:11:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Izzy, let me help Wargreymon! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.46,0:11:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Greyma needs help!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.12,0:11:49.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Matt, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:57.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look down there!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.22,0:12:00.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Matt's boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But where's Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:26.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope he's not hurt somewhere\Nwe'll never find him. What
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.34,0:12:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are we going to do tk's\Nright maybe we should go back
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.78,0:12:33.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and help the others fight\Nno Tai asked me to find the
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,others and that's what i'm\Ngonna do i won't let him down
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.44,0:12:40.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.66,0:12:42.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's some blood thing\Ncoming out of the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:46.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:49.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,TK!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:53.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, that sounds like Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.76,0:12:54.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sure does!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.52,0:12:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Matt, where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was so worried about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.94,0:13:03.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, TK, I needed time to get my head\Nstraight, but I won't leave you again,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.58,0:13:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:06.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gee, Matt, you look different.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.80,0:13:08.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you cut your hair or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.86,0:13:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I just haven't been using as much gel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.86,0:13:11.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Some black thing pulled\NSora down into that hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.54,0:13:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.45,0:13:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.42,0:13:22.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Matt, does this\Nremind you of anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it looks just like that\Ncave we were trapped in before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The same black thing\Nmust have gotten Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've seen it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.74,0:13:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, we've got to help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.48,0:13:32.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a good feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.46,0:13:33.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's scary.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you do, don't\Nbe afraid, okay, guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.86,0:13:38.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've realized that it's your\Nfear that feeds the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's easy for you to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.56,0:13:47.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right, Joe?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.34,0:13:51.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, fortunately I landed on the one part\Nof my body that has a built-in airbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:52.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.14,0:13:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where's Sora?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:55.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.98,0:13:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, I think I hear something\Ncoming from over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.96,0:13:59.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd call that a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.82,0:14:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.60,0:14:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please tell me what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.18,0:14:12.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's Violon's voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means Sora can't be far behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.94,0:14:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.76,0:14:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on, Violin. We're coming. Over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.40,0:14:27.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, what's the matter with you? Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.98,0:14:32.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's stuck. Let me help. On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.64,0:14:34.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, three.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.56,0:14:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once, it took four of us to get my\Ngrandmother off the toilet like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.00,0:14:41.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora's saying something. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.08,0:14:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to find Mimi and Joe and Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.10,0:14:50.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to help Tai or the\Nworld will be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.92,0:14:52.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.90,0:14:54.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no place like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.16,0:14:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She won't talk to me anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.78,0:14:59.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All she does is keep mumbling the\Nsame thing over and over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, Matt and I are right\Nhere. Look at me. Focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.10,0:15:05.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joe, you're really here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.74,0:15:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Matt's with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.80,0:15:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.71,0:15:12.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to be okay now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:13.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid not.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:15.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been trying hard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.32,0:15:17.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to get to Tai right\Naway and help him fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.98,0:15:21.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if I don't, the world\Nwill be completely destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.52,0:15:22.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:24.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't be responsible\Nfor saving the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.48,0:15:27.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to realize how strong\Nyour negative feelings are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.08,0:15:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They produce a powerful,\Ndestructive energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, it's the darkness in your heart that\Nhas created the cave in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.76,0:15:33.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.67,0:15:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really, Matt?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.59,0:15:35.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.50,0:15:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that why you told TK not to be scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.46,0:15:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.58,0:15:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one way to\Nmake this cave disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.44,0:15:46.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to reach deep into your heart\Nand erase all the negative feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.86,0:15:49.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:52.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.22,0:15:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to find the answer\Nto that question on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.16,0:16:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sora, this isn't the kind of thing\Nyou do just because you have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.48,0:16:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're going to do it, then\Nit has to be because you want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.26,0:16:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean that I don't have\Nto do it if I don't want to?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.54,0:16:08.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.45,0:16:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll only work if you want to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How will I know what the\Nright thing to do is?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.24,0:16:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When this whole thing started,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.80,0:16:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do you think we had any idea\Nwhat the right thing to do was?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:20.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that didn't stop us, did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we're here for a reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe we're the only ones who can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones who\Ncan make a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.38,0:16:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're finally\Ngetting through to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.36,0:16:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're the only ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.66,0:16:39.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.78,0:16:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.84,0:16:49.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:50.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were right, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.52,0:16:51.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.82,0:16:54.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I kind of went through\Nthe same thing myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.24,0:16:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.52,0:17:02.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy that you're the\Nold Sora, not the new Sora.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.34,0:17:05.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cave's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.94,0:17:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the darkness from Sora's\Nheart disappeared, so did the cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.18,0:17:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel so relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boy, wait till Tai hears about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.50,0:17:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.48,0:17:18.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ty's waiting for us right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.50,0:17:19.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.22,0:17:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.60,0:17:22.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trump's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up, Tai! Hey, Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.38,0:17:31.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Izzy, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.78,0:17:34.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stay there! Protect Kari!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.90,0:17:41.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.81,0:17:44.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's important for me\Nto stay here and protect Kari,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but in the meantime, who's\Ngoing to protect you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.08,0:17:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He tends to be a bit stubborn, doesn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.02,0:17:50.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about me. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.44,0:17:52.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got him right where I want him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.36,0:17:53.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.66,0:17:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.30,0:17:59.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm fine. That's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.36,0:18:02.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,General Custer said the exact\Nsame thing at Little Bighorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.26,0:18:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the history lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.32,0:18:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.36,0:18:06.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.36,0:18:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How come every time I ask, you\Nnever let me join in the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.24,0:18:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clone trick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.04,0:18:16.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Poor Greymon's been hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.98,0:18:23.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! WarGreymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.54,0:18:25.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.08,0:18:27.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, now who shall be next?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.50,0:18:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.58,0:18:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.56,0:18:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on, buddy! We're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.66,0:18:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, it's us!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.80,0:18:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're almost there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.60,0:18:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once upon a time, they were Digidestined.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.94,0:18:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now they're just sitting ducks\Nwaiting for me to take target practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.54,0:18:50.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.45,0:18:52.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt, you made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:53.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:56.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I made it, Tai.\NHang in there, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.06,0:19:00.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never doubted you for a second, Matt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.06,0:19:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it didn't always seem that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.38,0:19:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Tai, for believing in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just sorry I was so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.32,0:19:12.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, you have to know how much our\Nfriendship has always meant to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.52,0:19:15.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I swear nothing will\Never come between us again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.00,0:19:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,War Greymon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.24,0:19:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Matt,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.07,0:19:34.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,your Crest of Friendship gave me strength\Nand brought War Greymon back to normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.90,0:19:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Guru Roman.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.64,0:19:37.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I can fight again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.82,0:19:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, guys, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.66,0:19:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tai, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.38,0:19:44.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:48.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My first thought was to destroy you all\Ntogether in one nice little package.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:51.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now I believe I'd\Nrather do it individually,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.36,0:19:54.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so as to prolong your\Nsuffering a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:19:56.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should talk a lot for a clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.34,0:19:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trump Sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.82,0:20:15.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.64,0:20:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon! Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.66,0:20:23.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.86,0:20:25.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.86,0:20:27.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon are the champions!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.82,0:20:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon monsters!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.73,0:20:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Metal Garuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.82,0:20:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon? Ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.10,0:20:33.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now he'll see what we're made of!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.74,0:20:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Digimon, Digimon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.34,0:20:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Monster friends with the Rides and Hills!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.84,0:20:39.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They were able to break Kaibon's attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.06,0:20:40.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:44.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.26,0:20:48.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,could it actually be the case that I\Nfinally found an adversary worth fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.32,0:21:15.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be with you, I'm not afraid\Nto be able to go on an adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.26,0:21:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be with you, I'm not afraid\Nto be afraid of my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.70,0:21:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not afraid to be afraid of my future
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be with you, I'm not afraid\Nto be with you. I'm a smile
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the middle of\Nthe heart, a weakly self
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.14,0:21:40.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.50,0:21:45.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to get one more time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.46,0:21:51.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to fly with my courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.02,0:21:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.68,0:21:59.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be able to see my future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.72,0:22:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to go to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.72,0:22:10.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still starting to be a dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.72,0:22:15.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La La La
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.22,0:22:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,La La La
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.93,0:23:01.94,Sign,,0,0,320,,{\4c&H202020&\be1\bord1.5\3c&H000000&}{\fs30\b1}{\fad(300,0)}The Holy Swordsman! HolyAngemon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.32,0:23:02.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, the adventure evolves.

